{"id":"663911","name":"腐皮卷","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/663911/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肉沫","amount":"适量"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"韭黄","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"腐皮","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"胡萝卜洗净切细。","img":"images/663911/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"韭黄洗净切段。","img":"images/663911/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"木耳提前泡发后改刀切细。","img":"images/663911/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"前腿肉提前绞碎备用。","img":"images/663911/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量玉米淀粉，生抽，蚝油。","img":"images/663911/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/663911/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入准备好的配菜。","img":"images/663911/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量花生油和盐，抓拌均匀。","img":"images/663911/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"腐皮备用。","img":"images/663911/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"腐皮平铺开，放入馅料。","img":"images/663911/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"卷成一个个长卷。","img":"images/663911/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"锅中热油放入腐皮卷。","img":"images/663911/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"煎炸至金黄。","img":"images/663911/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"将腐皮卷放入盘中，锅中水开蒸十分钟左右。","img":"images/663911/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"蒸好后把汁倒出。","img":"images/663911/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"蒸出来的汤汁加入适量清水，少许盐和鸡精调味煮开。","img":"images/663911/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"适量淀粉水勾芡。","img":"images/663911/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"将芡汁淋在蒸好的腐皮卷上即可。","img":"images/663911/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663911/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663911/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663911/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663911/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}